                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_657461718">Flash is protected by Error Correction Code. In addition there is a checksum calculated and compared with an offline calculated checksum (execution within init task as well as cyclic task).</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
