                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1940986835">This failure is only used while development. It handles a failed assertion according the ANSI C standard. When an assertion fails then this failure is stored in Bosch Failure Memory, the program flow is aborted and the microcontroller is reset. After the reset the assertion handling is deactivated to be able to read the failure memory.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_1248298869">NA</SD>
