                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_540346431">Test checks if the voltage regulator configuration of the ASIC matches the software configuration. Additionally the result of the voltage regulator test is evaluated which is executed by the ASIC.</SD>
