                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1101825578">Monitoring of VPREU5V (internal voltage regulator) out of range bits. If VPREU5V is out of range a reset should be issued for the ASIC on which the out of range bits were detected.</SD>
