                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_515949875">Test evaluates UEXS (external 5V sensor supply) undervoltage bit after ASIC power-on in order to detect a short-circuit between VPRE (internal voltage pre-regulator) and UEXS (neighbor pins). If the bit is missing and an ADC is available on the UEXS path a SW-equivalent of the ASIC test will be executed. UEXS is switched off, after 20ms voltage on UEXS path has to drop below threshold.</SD>
