                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1318120785">This failure is logged when the supply voltage is below the level2 undervoltage threshold. The failure is recovered when the voltage rises above the threshold. A voltage hysteresis is considered to avoid toggling.</SD>
