                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_657865021">At ECU startup, the content of the following NvM items is checked: RPS_Rescaling, RPS_Orthogonality, RPS_Offset, RPS_CorrAmplitudes, RPS_CorrPhases, RPS_Version. Failure entry indicates that at least one value is missing or invalid.</SD>
